 <string name="privacy_body">No account, ads, trackers, analytics, or backend. Your schedules and reported bedtime stay on this device. Backups are written only to files you choose. Activity access is optional, processed locally, and queried only at reminder time.\n\nHoliday rules: persian-calendar/events (CC0 1.0). Iran lunar month starts: roozbehp/qamari (CC0 1.0). Date algorithm reference: jalaali-js (MIT). Estedad: SIL OFL 1.1. AndroidX: Apache 2.0. Full attributions are in the source repository.\n\nThis app records your reported bedtime. It does not measure actual sleep or sleep quality.</string>
